   "title": "Language",
   "section": "Preparatory Subject Matter",
   "rule": {
    "type": "manual",
    "text": "Students must complete two semesters of language instruction of the same language within the same department:\n- BANGLA\n- BURMESE\n- FILIPN\n- HINDI\n- INDONES\n- KHMER\n- MALAYI\n- PUNJABI\n- SANSKR\n- TAMIL\n- THAI\n- URDU\n- VIETNMS\nThese can be either lower or upper-division courses."
